---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<MainLayout title="Yoyo | 3D打印机器学习研究">

<Navbar />

<section class="project-page">

<a class="back-link" href="/resume">← 返回简历 <span class="en">← Back to Resume</span></a>

<div class="hero">
<div class="hero-icon">🖨️</div>
<h1>
基于机器学习的 3D 打印质量研究与参数优化
<span class="en">Machine Learning for 3D Printing Quality Research and Parameter Optimization</span>
</h1>
<p>
上海市大学生创新创业项目
<span class="en">Shanghai Innovation and Entrepreneurship Project</span>
</p>
</div>

<section class="card">
<h2>
项目概述
<span class="en">Project Overview</span>
</h2>
<p>
本项目聚焦增材制造（3D打印）的质量控制问题，利用机器学习技术对打印参数进行优化。通过融合物理信息神经网络（PINN）与传统机器学习方法，建立打印质量预测模型，为工艺参数选择提供智能决策支持。
<span class="en">This project focuses on quality control in additive manufacturing (3D printing) using machine learning to optimize printing parameters. By combining Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINN) with traditional ML methods, it builds a print quality prediction model.</span>
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
